"Corin knows the Tavelford ring is one of Maradoc's hidden gates, shut since before the Old Empire."
"Corin's order bids him watch the hidden gates and report any stirring to the House of Many Gates."
"Corin has walked these hills fourteen springs and never seen a hidden gate stir."
"Corin carries word between Maradoc's quiet faithful, and some of it is not about roads."
